### Phase 2 — Fix AI Predictor Table Tennis Data Pipeline

This is the root cause of the football matches appearing in the Rally (Table Tennis) predictor tab.

**Root cause identified:** The `rally` sport ID is mapped to `'Motorsport'` in `TSDB_SPORT`, `/motor|rally|formula/i` in `TSDB_SPORT_KEYS`, `'WRC'/'ERC'/'World Rally'` in `SPORT_LEAGUES` across betwatch.ts and fixtures.ts, and motor sport BetExplorer URLs in `FIXTURE_PAGES`. When none of these return valid matches (motor racing has very few vs-style fixtures), the fallback BetWatch scrape of `betwatch.fr` returns generic soccer rows because BetWatch is a soccer-dominant site. Those soccer rows then propagate to the Rally predictor tab.

