### Phase 4 — Add New Sports

Five new sports will be added: **American Football**, **Rugby Union**, **Cricket**, **MMA/UFC**, and **Volleyball**.

Each sport requires:
1. Convex schema update (new `v.literal()`)
2. Backend type updates (`PREDICTOR_SPORTS`, `PredictorSportId`)
3. API configuration (Odds API keys, TheSportsDB sport name, SharpAPI leagues)
4. Data pipeline: SPORT_LEAGUES, FIXTURE_PAGES, MARKET_GROUPS
5. Screener route (full Matchday Screener page with engine factory)
6. Predictor route (`/predictor/american-football`, etc.)
7. Landing page sport card
8. BottomNav + SportSvgIcon entries
9. Cron jobs (nightly cache refresh)
10. SEO (sitemap, RSS feed)

